{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The court is peaceful after dark. No one around to disrupt your focus. Just you, a ball, and a whole lot of crickets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a high schooler with terrible grades. You're banking your college admissions on a basketball scholarship, so you put in the hours every evening. While your friends are out partying, you're on the grind. But tonight... you don't feel quite so alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your shots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the locals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get home by midnight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short atmospheric horror experience with a light basketball twist :)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095020?t=1774899842","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095020?t=1774899842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095020/4b58a76504f1f270c876a22b0ad488dcae7afb75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774899842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095020/4b58a76504f1f270c876a22b0ad488dcae7afb75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774899842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Midnight Hoops includes mentions and imagery of tobacco and alcohol. There is some implied violence and a few intentionally fear-inducing sequences, as well as \"creepy\" imagery, but no actual depictions of violent acts."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The court is peaceful after dark. No one around to disrupt your focus. Just you, a